{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "15713c6f-b086-8c8b-aae9-1b1e35e87955",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T12:40:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ricardo Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 45,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon, my name is Ricardo Salazar, I'm at 412 Dixon Street in the North End, and I'm calling about the plowing after the storm Sunday and Monday, the one that started as snow and turned to rain, that was three days ago now, and my street still has a hard packed layer of slush and ice down the middle because Dixon is a dead end and the dead end always gets plowed last, every storm it's the same, the plow gets to us after everybody else is done, and I just want somebody to know that and put it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. Dixon Street, 412, North End. Let me write that down. So the street was plowed late, or it hasn't been done well at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:38:54-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was plowed eventually, Tuesday I think, but only one pass, and it's rutted and icy now that it froze again. The end of the street where the turnaround is, that's the worst part. And the street smells like woodsmoke most evenings, so people are home, they're trying to get out in the morning, and it's hard going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, understood. Dead ends do tend to be the last stop on the route, that's pretty common after a big storm. I'll log it as a complaint for the street, late plow and icy rutted surface near the turnaround."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Can you log it so there's a record that I called?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, it's going in now. Dixon Street, caller Ricardo Salazar, plowed late and one pass only, ice at the dead end. Do you want a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:39:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0186."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five five five, oh one eight six, area code 401. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:40:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:40:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll pass it to the crew supervisor so they see it before the next one. I can't tell you exactly when they'll get back out there, but it's on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:40:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. That's all I needed. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:40:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mr. Salazar. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:40:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
